\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/r_line.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"177\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"107\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/vid_anim.gif\" width=\"163\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"323\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"red\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">UO LBR</span></b></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><span class=\"highlight\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">제품 정보:</font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br>제품명 : 로드 블랙쏜의 \n복수<br>판매원: Electronic Arts<br>개발: Origin Systems<br>사용환경: Windows95/98/XP \nCD-Rom<br>장르: MMORPG (Massively Multiplayer Online Role-Playing Game)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"223\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>[내용물]</b></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">로드 블랙쏜 액션 피겨 (1000장 한정) \n</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울티마 온라인 Full Color </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">상세 초보 가이드 \n로드 블랙쏜 매뉴얼 \n</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">고급 브리타니아 및 일쉐나 맵</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">도시 &amp; 던젼 세부 지도책<br></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"327\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span class=\"highlight\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">시스템 최소 사양:</font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br>-펜티엄 II 300,<br>-28.8 \n모뎀,<br>-64 MB 램<br>-DirectX호환 12MB이상의 램을 가진 그래픽카드,<br>-Windows 95 또는그 이상의 OS \n시스템,<br>-Windows 호환 가능한 사운드 카드,<br>-4X이상의 CD-ROM<br>-약 600MB 이상의 전체설치를 위한 하드 디스크 공간 \n</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span class=\"highlight\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">-새로운 세계에서 찾아내야 할 새로운 기능들</font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"167\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/coupon_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"252\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:200/252\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울티마 온라인: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">최신 \n                                        버전인 <b>로드 블랙쏜의 복수</b>를 구입하시면 \n                                        2D/3D를 선택해서 플레이 하실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">시디를 \n                                        구입하시고 계정등록을 하시는 방법은 \n                                        시디 매뉴얼을 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">참조하시고 \n                                        본홈 좌측메뉴의 초보자지침서를 이용하시길 \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울티마온라인의 \n                                        한달이용료는 약 10,500~11,000으로 타 \n                                        게임보다도 훨씬 저렴합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또한 \n                                        이번 블랙쏜의복수는 가격대 만족도가 \n                                        상당히 높으므로</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아직 \n                                        울온을 경험해 보지 못한 플레이어들에게는 \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좋은 \n                                        기회입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">p.s \n                                        : 1개월 무료이용도 포합되어 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><a href=\"http://www.kr.uo.com\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\">ORIGIN</font></span></b></a></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><a href=\"#top\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/top_up.gif\" width=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
